[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The lifecycle widget ranks states by longest path

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[WORK]
UID: WORK-FSM-WIDGET-RANK-ORDER
TITLE: The lifecycle widget ranks states by longest path
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The Grammars tab's lifecycle widget orders states by longest path from the
initial state, so a state reachable by a short and a long path is drawn at the
far rank rather than where the lifecycle reads. Payload order is honoured only
within a rank, which means the author cannot correct the layout from the
semantics payload. Cheapest fix: rank by shortest path, or let the payload
declare rank explicitly.
<<<
